 ## Overview
 
-The API exposes five main endpoints organized by resource type:
+The API exposes four main endpoints organized by resource type:
 
 - **`/position/stake/{owner}`** — Stake positions (standard AMM / CPMM LP)
 - **`/position/clmm-lock/{owner}`** — Locked CLMM positions
 - **`/create-pool/{owner}`** — Pools created by this wallet
 - **`/main/ido/{owner}`** — IDO participation data
+
+## Farm rewards
+
+The [stake positions endpoint](/api-reference/owner-api-v1-endpoints/position/get-stake-positions-for-a-wallet) returns cached stake data. It does not return pending reward amounts or reward mints.
+
+Use `raydium.farm.fetchFarmBalances()` to calculate pending rewards with Solana RPC access. See the [wallet integration example](/integration-guides/wallet-integration#farm-stake) for amount units and calculation limits.
 
